The Badalassi Carlo Pueblo leather is a top quality leather made in Toscani, Italia and has a strong label you will receive with each product made with this leather. ([Official Page](https://www.pellealvegetale.it/tanneries/badalassi-carlo/))

This leather wears a marble texture aspect that makes it classy and original.

It takes a wonderful patina with the age that makes it even more authentic. The creations made with this leather is a promise of a lifetime lasting product.

